@startuml
title Content｜單則內容狀態
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft JhengHei
hide empty description
state "草稿中 / drafting" as drafting
state "待改稿 / review" as review
state "製作中 / producing" as producing
state "待成品確認 / ready" as ready
state "已確認 / approved" as approved
state "已發布 / published" as published
[*] --> drafting : 選題並執行 produce / 建立內容
drafting --> review : 草稿生成成功 / 提供來源與預覽
review --> drafting : 要求重生草稿 / 保留人工稿
review --> producing : 啟動製作 [稿件與必要素材已備妥]
producing --> ready : 輸出成功 / 保存成品版本
ready --> review : 要求修改 / 標記成品需重製
ready --> approved : 人確認 [待確認項已處理] / 綁定版本
approved --> review : 修改內容 / 撤銷本版本確認
approved --> published : 記錄實際發布 [版本已確認]
published --> published : 另一平台發布／回填成效 / 更新對應紀錄
@enduml